## Model card

- **Name:** Claude Sonnet 5.4 (as named by the slug; no such vendor product was found)
- **Short description:** No model by this name exists in any authoritative source consulted. Anthropic's Sonnet line runs Claude Sonnet 4.5 → 4.6 → 5 → 5.5; there is no 5.4 checkpoint, API ID, or provider route.
- **Provider / access:** none found. Anthropic's current Anthropic-operated platform tables list Active models `claude-sonnet-5-5`, `claude-sonnet-5`, `claude-sonnet-4-6`, `claude-sonnet-4-5-20250929` (Deprecated 2026-09-30) — no `claude-sonnet-5-4` or `claude-sonnet-5.4` anywhere, active or legacy.
- **Release / knowledge:** not found.
- **IDs:** none verified. OpenRouter's complete Anthropic catalog (an independent, near-exhaustive listing) contains `anthropic/claude-sonnet-4.5`, `claude-sonnet-4.6`, `claude-sonnet-5`, `claude-sonnet-5.5` — and no `claude-sonnet-5.4`. models.dev's full database (a third independent catalog) likewise lists Anthropic Sonnet 4.5 / 4.6 / 5 / 5.5 only.
- **Context window:** not verifiable — no model to measure.
- **Modalities:** not verifiable.
- **Pricing:** not verifiable.
- **Architecture:** not verifiable.

